    {
      "id": "koshik1",
      "text": "First, Koshik the elephant. For years, his only friends at a South Korean zoo were humans.",
      "sfx": [
        [
          "elephant",
          3
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "koshik2",
      "text": "So he learned to speak their language."
    },
    {
      "id": "koshik3",
      "text": "By sticking his trunk in his mouth, he can say five Korean words, like hello, sit down, and no.",
      "sfx": [
        [
